{
  "name": "1688 Reverse Image Search Scraper: Photo to Factory API — Automated Extraction to CSV & Sheets (UnitBytes)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ 1688 Reverse Image Search Scraper: Photo to Factory API — Automated n8n Pipeline\n**Powered by [UnitBytes on Apify](https://apify.com/unitbytes/1688-image-search-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.005 / item)\n\n### ⚙️ How It Works\nThis workflow runs on a schedule, calls the **[1688-image-search-scraper Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/1688-image-search-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** via its synchronous REST endpoint, normalizes the extracted fields (`id, offerId, searchType, searchImage, imageId`), and exports a clean CSV file.\n\n### 🚀 30-Second Setup Instructions\n1. **Get your free Apify API Token**: Open [1688-image-search-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/1688-image-search-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) and copy your API token from **Settings → Integrations**.\n2. **Paste your token & search parameters**: Double-click the **\"1. Set Apify Token & Input\"** node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. **Click \"Test Workflow\"**: The HTTP Request node calls the synchronous UnitBytes Apify endpoint, normalizes the extracted records, and exports a clean CSV file ready for Google Sheets, Airtable, Slack, or OpenAI.\n\n📖 **Documentation & Schema Reference**: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/1688-image-search-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/1688-image-search-scraper/)",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "041d4277-334c-5f30-ad43-3818a8aa3e05",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📊 Connect Your Destination\nThe **\"3. Normalize Output Fields\"** node outputs flat records (`id, offerId, searchType, searchImage, imageId`).\n\n- **Google Sheets / Airtable**: Connect a Google Sheets (`Append or Update Row`) node after Step 3.\n- **Slack / Telegram / Email Alerts**: Connect a Filter node + Slack node to alert your team on new deals or reviews.\n- **AI Agent / OpenAI**: Connect an OpenAI / LLM Chain node to summarize or classify extracted items.",
